WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
[Quiet: a village at dawn]

00:03.530 --> 00:06.050
[Helicopter rotors as a Mohawk lifts off]

00:06.070 --> 00:09.480
[Artillery shells explode in the village]

00:09.500 --> 00:11.900
[Gunfire in the burning village]

00:11.930 --> 00:14.850
[A tank fires; explosions along the trench line]

00:14.870 --> 00:18.380
[A-10 gun run, then a fireball]

00:18.400 --> 00:21.400
[The patrol ship's guns open up]

00:21.430 --> 00:24.350
[A string of bombs explodes along the shore]

00:24.370 --> 00:27.280
[AC-130 cannon fire over the town at night]

00:27.300 --> 00:32.900
[A rocket barrage slams into the town]
